71
00:11:24,460 --> 00:11:29,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dear colleagues, secretaries, and members of the Cabinet present here today,

72
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:33,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: my fellow workers in government, members of the Media Civil Society,

73
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:38,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to all our fellow Filipinos, good morning to all of you.

74
00:11:38,460 --> 00:11:44,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As we convene the Development Budget Coordination Committee, or the DBCC today,

75
00:11:44,460 --> 00:11:50,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we undertake the solemn duty of deliberating the National Budget of 2027.

76
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:52,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As Chair of the Committee on Finance,

77
00:11:52,460 --> 00:12:00,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I reaffirm our steadfast commitment to deliver a budget that serves as a reflection of the genuine needs of our people,

78
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:02,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: especially those in need.

79
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:04,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Today, we go back to the basics.

80
00:12:04,460 --> 00:12:07,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Let's go back to the basic needs of our fellow citizens.

81
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:13,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Health, education, food, livelihood, security, and proper infrastructure.

82
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:16,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And so that our projects will not be divided into pieces,

83
00:12:16,460 --> 00:12:22,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we need a long-term, comprehensive infrastructure master plan

84
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:26,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that connects our roads, railways, airports, seaports, and communities,

85
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:30,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and supports the country's development for generations to come.

86
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:34,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: These should remain at the heart of our priorities.

87
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:39,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, the budget process can be complex, filled with accounting terms and figures,

88
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:43,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but we must not lose sight of what those numbers are meant to accomplish.

89
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:47,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Beyond economic buzzwords and elaborate theories,

90
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:50,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: what our people need now is action on the part of their government,

91
00:12:50,260 --> 00:12:57,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: as the people we serve are not mere statistics on a piece of paper in a stack of reports.

92
00:12:57,260 --> 00:13:04,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They are families, breadwinners, farmers, students, and citizens counting on their government to deliver.

93
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:06,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That is why we are helping.

94
00:13:06,260 --> 00:13:14,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The 2027 budget is a budget that will address the primary needs or basic needs of our citizens.

95
00:13:14,260 --> 00:13:16,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: A people's budget.

96
00:13:16,260 --> 00:13:20,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This is where we fully agree with the budget message of President Bongbong Marcos,

97
00:13:20,260 --> 00:13:25,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for when we invest in our people, we invest in the future of our nation.

98
00:13:25,260 --> 00:13:30,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We have witnessed the problems faced by our country,

99
00:13:30,260 --> 00:13:35,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: especially when it comes to corruption and the wrong use of the country's budget.

100
00:13:35,260 --> 00:13:46,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We hear your concerns and understand your feelings and calls for transparency and trust in the government.

101
00:13:46,260 --> 00:13:50,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As the Chairman of the Senate Committee on Finance,

102
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:54,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we will not allow the country's budget to go to waste,

103
00:13:54,260 --> 00:13:58,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to go to waste, and to go to the wrong hands.

104
00:13:58,260 --> 00:14:04,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Every penny, every cent should only go to the programs and projects

105
00:14:04,260 --> 00:14:10,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that are included in the budget proposal and the agenda discussed in the plenary.

106
00:14:10,260 --> 00:14:16,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And the plan will serve the right purpose and the well-being of your citizens.

107
00:14:16,260 --> 00:14:19,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As we formally begin these deliberations,

108
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:26,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I want to underscore and emphasize our clear intention to go back to basics in crafting this budget.

109
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:29,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In going back to basics, we mean accountability.

110
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:33,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For every peso, we appropriate that is focused and clear-eyed

111
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:39,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: about the basic needs of the people such as health, education, infrastructure

112
00:14:39,160 --> 00:14:46,570
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that will generate quality jobs for the people and to put the food on the table.

113
00:14:46,670 --> 00:14:48,270
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So in terms of accountability,

114
00:14:48,270 --> 00:14:52,450
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Noong nakaraang taon, pinamunuan ni Senate President Win Gatchalian ang Senate

115
00:14:52,450 --> 00:14:54,110
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: deliberations sa

116
00:14:54,110 --> 00:14:57,750
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2026 budget, sinimulan niya ang mahalagang

117
00:14:57,750 --> 00:14:59,970
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: reforma para gawing transparent

118
00:14:59,970 --> 00:15:03,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at mas accessible sa nakakarami ang budget process.

119
00:15:04,540 --> 00:15:10,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ngayong taon, ipagpatuloy at paiigtingin pa natin ang mga nasimulan niyang reforma.

120
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:14,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasama ng ating vice chairpersons at mga kasamahan sa Senado,

121
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:20,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: iwawak si natin ang pagwawaldas, susuriin ang bawat programa,

122
00:15:20,860 --> 00:15:23,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at sisiyasatin ang bawat ahensya.

123
00:15:24,060 --> 00:15:27,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dahil back to basics, dapat may pananagutan sa bawat piso

124
00:15:27,920 --> 00:15:31,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at bawat sentimo ang ginagastos ng gobyerno.

125
00:15:32,340 --> 00:15:37,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa lahat ng mga naging kontrobersya, lalo na sa mga kwestyonabling flood control projects,

126
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:41,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: hindi pwedeng maging business as usual na lamang ang ating budget process.

127
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:43,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We must learn from our mistakes.

128
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:46,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We must earn back the public's trust.

129
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:50,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we must restore the integrity of this sacred mandate.

130
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Here's how we can make this happen.

131
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:57,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Any individual amendments should be made on the floor.

132
00:15:57,920 --> 00:16:00,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: During budget deliberations and debates.

133
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:01,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Full stop.

134
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:10,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pabantayan at ipagbabawal na natin ang anumang last-minute insertions sa Bicameral Conference Committee.

135
00:16:10,700 --> 00:16:14,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will continue live-streaming the Bicameral Conference Committee

136
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:17,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and maintaining the Senate Budget Transparency Portal

137
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:21,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for the public to see and appreciate how the budget evolves

138
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:24,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: from proposal to budget enactment.

139
00:16:26,380 --> 00:16:27,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa pagpapatuloy ng anti-evolvement,

140
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:28,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ipagpal-provision,

141
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:33,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: titiyakin natin na ang ipamamahagi ay walang political branding o pakikialam.

142
00:16:34,580 --> 00:16:39,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will also continue to work with civil society organizations and other stakeholders,

143
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:40,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the academe,

144
00:16:41,020 --> 00:16:42,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in monitoring the process,

145
00:16:42,800 --> 00:16:47,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: patuloy natin pakikinggan ang kanilang mga pananaw at rekomendasyon

146
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:52,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: habang sinusuri natin ang mga programa at pondong hinihingi ng bawat ahensya.

147
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At the same time,

148
00:16:55,460 --> 00:16:57,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: transparency and accountability must lead.

149
00:16:57,920 --> 00:17:00,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: To better public service, not paralysis.

150
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:06,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We must address irregularities and strengthen safeguards against abuse

151
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:13,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: while ensuring that legitimate infrastructure projects continue without the necessary delay.

152
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:19,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang dapat natin pigilan ay korupsyon at anomalya, hindi ang pag-unlad.

153
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:24,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Muli ang unang hakbang sa ating back-to-basics ay accountability.

154
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:27,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sunod naman ang pagtiyak na tama at napakalimutan.

155
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:31,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Napapanuhon ang mga preridad na ating pagkakagastusan.

156
00:17:32,360 --> 00:17:34,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa bawat ahensya ng gobyerno,

157
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:35,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nahaharap sa atin,

158
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:38,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: simple ngunit mahalagang tanong.

159
00:17:38,820 --> 00:17:40,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang nais nating masagot,

160
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:44,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kailangan ba talaga ang pondong ito?

161
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:47,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Makatuwiran ba ang halaga?

162
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Handa na ba ang proyekto?

163
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:52,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailan ba ito matatapos?

164
00:17:52,060 --> 00:17:55,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At sino ang mananagot kung hindi ito maipapatupad?

165
00:17:55,460 --> 00:18:03,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lagi't lagi nating i-considera ang necessity at feasibility sa pagtalakay ng budget.

166
00:18:03,340 --> 00:18:08,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi po ito para lamang pahirapan ang mga ahensya.

167
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:11,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa usaping health care.

168
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Unahin na po natin,

169
00:18:14,500 --> 00:18:20,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dahil siguro alam naman po [unclear], ito po ang isa sa ating pangunahing legislative agenda.

170
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:24,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Being the principal sponsor and author of the universal healthcare law,

171
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:27,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I would say that

172
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:30,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: definitely we will give priority

173
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:33,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to healthcare implementation this time.

174
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:40,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At the very outset of the Senate budget deliberation, I want to make our positions clear as Chairman of the Committee of Finance.

175
