00:43:00,920 --> 00:43:02,220
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: to our banks.

579
00:43:02,520 --> 00:43:07,400
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: And from an economic perspective, we want to ensure we can support the değilism of both

