00:43:07,400 --> 00:43:09,480
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: households and businesses.

581
00:43:10,260 --> 00:43:16,260
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: And here we show some of the developments in terms of access to financial services.

