625
00:47:04,060 --> 00:47:10,740
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: So these important inflows are vital to make sure that our external position

626
00:47:10,740 --> 00:47:14,740
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: remains manageable and sustainable over time.

627
00:47:15,280 --> 00:47:21,680
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: We also highlight that we maintain some buffers regarding our external,

