Senator Risa Hontiveros: mawalang galang lang po,

1058
01:17:18,080 --> 01:17:20,760
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na mag-deteriorate yung fiscal space

1059
01:17:20,760 --> 01:17:22,600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: over the past few years.

1060
01:17:23,420 --> 01:17:27,040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kaya, niririp na natin ngayon yung ginawa

1061
01:17:27,040 --> 01:17:29,140
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at hindi ginawa nung nakaraang mga taon.

1062
01:17:29,140 --> 01:17:30,740
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Maybe yung tanong ko ay,

1063
01:17:31,660 --> 01:17:34,560
Senator Risa Hontiveros: the DBCC would be willing to recognize that

1064
01:17:34,560 --> 01:17:35,520
Senator Risa Hontiveros: around the table.

1065
01:17:36,160 --> 01:17:38,620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Siguro, mula sa perspektiba ng Banko Sentral,

1066
01:17:39,000 --> 01:17:41,900
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ano yung kahit isang pinaka-importanting adjustment

1067
01:17:41,900 --> 01:17:45,600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na dapat natin gawin mula sa Banko Sentral

1068
01:17:45,600 --> 01:17:46,860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: and mula sa DBCC

1069
01:17:46,860 --> 01:17:50,760
Senator Risa Hontiveros: to guide us naman po sa paghubog

1070
01:17:50,760 --> 01:17:53,380
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ng isang Budget 2027

1071
01:17:53,380 --> 01:17:56,620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na mas may contingency planning

1072
01:17:56,620 --> 01:17:58,260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at paghahanda internally

1073
01:17:58,260 --> 01:18:01,320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: para sa external shocks na alam naman natin,

1074
01:18:01,320 --> 01:18:02,940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: yung patuloy nating mararanasan.

1075
01:18:04,940 --> 01:18:06,140
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Maganda pong tanong yan.

1076
01:18:07,040 --> 01:18:08,180
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Kaya, nang sabi ko,

1077
01:18:09,260 --> 01:18:10,660
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: nagse-scenario na kami ngayon.

1078
01:18:12,160 --> 01:18:13,520
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Merong sinaryo na masama,

1079
01:18:13,700 --> 01:18:14,740
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: may sinaryo na maganda,

1080
01:18:15,600 --> 01:18:17,900
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: pero yung mga sinaryo na yun,

1081
01:18:18,320 --> 01:18:19,300
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: yung masama halimbawa,

1082
01:18:19,560 --> 01:18:21,280
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: you have to prepare for the worst.

1083
01:18:22,700 --> 01:18:23,720
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hindi pwede yung dating

1084
01:18:23,720 --> 01:18:25,740
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: kung ano lang yung expected.

1085
01:18:27,600 --> 01:18:31,840
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yun ang ginagawa namin sa BSP.

1086
01:18:31,840 --> 01:18:32,580
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Although, I'm sure,

1087
01:18:32,600 --> 01:18:38,300
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: the government has other contingency measures

1088
01:18:38,300 --> 01:18:40,000
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: as you suggested.

1089
01:18:41,120 --> 01:18:41,920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat, Gov.

1090
01:18:42,100 --> 01:18:43,840
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Tatanong ko na lang sa ibang agencies mamaya

1091
01:18:43,840 --> 01:18:45,480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: yung contingency measures na yun.

1092
01:18:45,560 --> 01:18:46,340
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat, Mr. Chair.

1093
01:18:47,440 --> 01:18:49,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, next is our Senate President,

1094
01:18:49,840 --> 01:18:50,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Win Gatchalian.

1095
01:18:50,740 --> 01:18:51,340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you.

1096
01:18:52,160 --> 01:18:55,020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll take advantage of the presence ni Governor.

1097
01:18:56,700 --> 01:18:59,140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think we all agree na this year,

1098
01:18:59,880 --> 01:19:01,580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: we can describe

1099
01:19:01,580 --> 01:19:02,580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: yung ating

1100
01:19:02,600 --> 01:19:32,600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: economy in two letters, two letter C's. Number one, conflict. The U.S.-Iran conflict. Tama ho kayo, Governor, very limited yung control natin dito sa U.S.-Iran conflict because external ito. Number two is corruption. Because of the flood control issue, bumagal ang government spending, particularly construction. Now, ang BSP plays

1101
01:19:32,600 --> 01:19:37,700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: a role in this fight against corruption, particularly through AMLAC.

1102
01:19:38,420 --> 01:19:43,980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And through the investigations ng Senate, particularly spearheaded by Senator Lacson,

1103
01:19:45,160 --> 01:19:49,380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: nakita ho namin na napakadaming transaction na pumapasok sa bangko,

1104
01:19:49,560 --> 01:19:53,200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: lumalabas sa bangko, na hindi na didetect ng AMLAC.

1105
01:19:54,020 --> 01:19:59,000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In fact, na-detect na yan, sumabog na yung corruption sa mukha natin.

1106
01:19:59,000 --> 01:20:03,480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: One case in point, yung binuksan ni Senator Kiko Pangilinan, yung land bank,

1107
01:20:04,040 --> 01:20:11,140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na naka-withdraw ng cash, 500 million, not only once, but multiple times.

1108
01:20:13,540 --> 01:20:19,180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So because of that, during last year, through the efforts of Senator Lacson,

1109
01:20:19,300 --> 01:20:25,700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: nagdagdag ng 162 million to AMLAC to fully computerize its processes.

1110
01:20:25,700 --> 01:20:28,740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi ang sagot sa amin, hindi ho namin na-detect,

1111
01:20:28,740 --> 01:20:31,520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: dahil libo-libo yung pumapasok na covered transaction,

1112
01:20:31,660 --> 01:20:36,620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: libo-libo yung pumapasok na suspicious transaction, walang analytical capabilities.

1113
01:20:38,040 --> 01:20:44,440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But yan ang precisely kung bakit tayo merong Anti-Money Laundering Council,

1114
01:20:44,500 --> 01:20:49,560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: is to detect this type of fraud activity so that hindi na ho siya lumala.

1115
01:20:50,460 --> 01:20:54,180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dahil yung paglalaan nito, it affects our economy as well.

1116
01:20:54,180 --> 01:20:57,560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang knee-jerk sa action natin, government, hindi gagastos.

1117
01:20:57,860 --> 01:20:58,620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At lahat ho tayo.

1118
01:20:58,740 --> 01:20:59,500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Apektado dito.

1119
01:20:59,640 --> 01:21:03,780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Now my question, Governor, being the chairperson or the chairman of AMLAC,

1120
01:21:04,500 --> 01:21:09,080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ano ba ang mga reformang ginawa ng BSP to AMLAC

1121
01:21:09,080 --> 01:21:14,200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: in order to prevent this type of mega-corruption from happening again?

1122
01:21:16,020 --> 01:21:18,160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi nakaka-apekto ho yan sa atin.

1123
01:21:18,560 --> 01:21:20,860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And ito is something that we can control.

1124
01:21:20,860 --> 01:21:24,260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama ho kayo. Yung price of oil, hindi ho natin makakontrol yan.

1125
01:21:24,720 --> 01:21:28,220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero corruption, we can control that. Eliminate or mitigate.

1126
01:21:28,740 --> 01:21:35,860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And AMLAC is one of the key actors to mitigate or even eliminate corruption.

1127
01:21:36,040 --> 01:21:40,420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So we want to know, what are the efforts of AMLAC through the BSP,

1128
01:21:41,060 --> 01:21:44,380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: because kayo po ang chairperson, para po hindi na maulit

1129
01:21:44,380 --> 01:21:48,860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: yung ganitong mga transactions pumapasok at labas na hindi ho natin na-detect.

1130
01:21:49,340 --> 01:21:55,250
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: I think, Senator, you put your finger on the problem.

1131
01:21:55,790 --> 01:21:59,250
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tama po kayo na nahihirapan kami nung...

1132
01:22:00,950 --> 01:22:02,830
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: sa trabaho namin.

1133
01:22:02,990 --> 01:22:07,350
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Although, nakalabas naman tayo sa grade list last year.

1134
01:22:07,750 --> 01:22:09,010
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pero kulang pa rin yun.

1135
01:22:10,330 --> 01:22:14,830
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ang nakikita lang po namin, yung tinatawag na CTR,

1136
01:22:15,010 --> 01:22:18,570
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Covered Transactions Report, anything that's over 500,000 pesos

1137
01:22:18,570 --> 01:22:20,810
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: na pumapasok sa banko, nakikita namin yun.

1138
01:22:21,070 --> 01:22:25,110
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tapos merong STR, yung Suspicious Transactions Report,

1139
01:22:25,250 --> 01:22:30,070
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: na finafile ng mga banko kung suspicious sila dun sa transaction.

1140
01:22:30,950 --> 01:22:31,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Million-million po yan eh.

1141
01:22:32,490 --> 01:22:35,830
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ang dumating sa amin na STR, million-million sa dami.

1142
01:22:36,050 --> 01:22:37,250
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Araw-araw marami eh.

1143
01:22:37,910 --> 01:22:40,530
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So ngayon, meron na kaming kinukuhang AI

1144
01:22:40,530 --> 01:22:45,150
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: na nakakatulong sa pag-analyze,

1145
01:22:45,290 --> 01:22:50,930
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: nakakahanap ng mga red flags dun sa mga STRs at saka mga CTR.

1146
01:22:51,710 --> 01:22:55,510
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ngayon, kung meron kaming makitang medyo suspicious,

1147
01:22:56,410 --> 01:23:00,930
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: kailangan namin mag-file sa Court of Appeals

1148
01:23:00,950 --> 01:23:05,330
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: ng petition for a freeze.

1149
01:23:06,890 --> 01:23:12,510
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pero kailangan mabusisi yung, kailangan may predicate crime eh.

1150
01:23:14,970 --> 01:23:22,330
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Wala kaming power dahil sa bank secrecy na silipin yung mga bank accounts mismo.

1151
01:23:23,210 --> 01:23:26,070
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hanggang STR lang kami at saka CTR.

1152
01:23:27,070 --> 01:23:30,130
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tapos, pagdating sa Court of Appeals,

1153
01:23:30,950 --> 01:23:32,550
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: pwede silang pumayag na i-freeze.

1154
01:23:32,650 --> 01:23:34,710
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pwede rin hindi sila pumayag na i-freeze.

1155
01:23:35,890 --> 01:23:37,370
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Kailangan kasi ng probable cause.

1156
01:23:37,530 --> 01:23:41,650
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Kailangan ng predicate crime at saka probable cause.

1157
01:23:42,170 --> 01:23:45,270
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So medyo nakatali yung mga kamay namin dyan.

1158
01:23:47,470 --> 01:23:48,110
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you.

1159
01:23:48,410 --> 01:23:50,370
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Permission to interject very quickly.

1160
01:23:50,430 --> 01:23:50,790
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes, yes.

1161
01:23:50,890 --> 01:23:54,730
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Gusto ko lang i-follow up kasi nabanggit ni Senate President Sherwin

1162
01:23:54,730 --> 01:23:58,670
Senator Panfilo Lacson: yung integration through his and my initiative.

1163
01:23:59,430 --> 01:24:00,890
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nagdagdag kami ng 160.

1164
01:24:00,950 --> 01:24:04,470
Senator Panfilo Lacson: 162 million pesos dahil yun ang problema ng AMLAC.

1165
01:24:05,050 --> 01:24:06,010
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Gusto ko lang malaman,

1166
01:24:07,090 --> 01:24:10,610
Senator Panfilo Lacson: paano nakatulong sa exercise nalang ng oversight namin?

1167
01:24:11,230 --> 01:24:15,970
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nasaan na tayo ngayon doon sa naitulong namin konting halaga na 162 million?

1168
01:24:16,650 --> 01:24:19,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nag-improve po ba yung kapasidad ng AMLAC?

1169
01:24:21,110 --> 01:24:21,590
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Salamat po.

1170
01:24:22,430 --> 01:24:24,970
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tama po. Binigyan lang ako ng kodigo dito.

1171
01:24:25,790 --> 01:24:27,890
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yung 125 million,

1172
01:24:28,790 --> 01:24:30,770
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: napunta yun sa AI.

1173
01:24:30,950 --> 01:24:32,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tapos yung capacity building,

1174
01:24:32,950 --> 01:24:36,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: kailangan din ng mga experts sa paggamit ng AI.

1175
01:24:36,950 --> 01:24:40,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So gamit na gamit po yung budget na yun.

1176
01:24:40,950 --> 01:24:42,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So nakatulong po sa madalit-salita?

1177
01:24:42,950 --> 01:24:43,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Absolutely.

1178
01:24:43,950 --> 01:24:45,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hindi lang reconciled yung record natin.

1179
01:24:45,950 --> 01:24:48,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sa record ng aming Senate President, 162.

1180
01:24:48,950 --> 01:24:49,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sa inyo, 125.

1181
01:24:49,950 --> 01:24:51,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Saan napunta yung butal?

1182
01:24:51,950 --> 01:24:54,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: O na po later release.

1183
01:24:54,950 --> 01:24:56,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Meron pang iba.

1184
01:24:56,950 --> 01:24:59,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you po, President.

1185
01:24:59,950 --> 01:25:00,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you.

1186
01:25:00,950 --> 01:25:01,950
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, Senator Pangilinan.

1187
01:25:01,950 --> 01:25:06,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, on the point earlier raised by Senate President Win.

1188
01:25:06,950 --> 01:25:07,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It's correct.

1189
01:25:07,950 --> 01:25:12,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I was the one who raised these questions with the land bank during the flood control hearings.

1190
01:25:12,950 --> 01:25:17,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The release of 520 plus million.

1191
01:25:17,950 --> 01:25:22,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 543 million cash.

1192
01:25:22,950 --> 01:25:24,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The question there is,

1193
01:25:24,950 --> 01:25:29,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: does AMLA have the mechanism to be able to zero in, for example,

1194
01:25:29,950 --> 01:25:33,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: on our government banks?

1195
01:25:33,950 --> 01:25:39,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the government depository banks are under the AMLA.

1196
01:25:39,950 --> 01:25:46,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: All funds, public funds, are placed in the depository banks.

1197
01:25:46,950 --> 01:25:51,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So there should be a mechanism to segregate, perhaps.

1198
01:25:51,950 --> 01:25:52,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It is correct.

1199
01:25:52,950 --> 01:25:56,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ang nangyari doon, because of the suspicious transaction report,

1200
01:25:56,950 --> 01:25:58,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: daily covered transaction report,

1201
01:25:58,950 --> 01:26:02,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ang ginawa, you created a haystack.

1202
01:26:02,950 --> 01:26:04,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And now you're looking for the needle.

1203
01:26:04,950 --> 01:26:05,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Hindi ba?

1204
01:26:05,950 --> 01:26:07,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So AI will help.

1205
01:26:07,950 --> 01:26:08,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: That's right.

1206
01:26:08,950 --> 01:26:13,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But perhaps there should be some restructuring of the reporting system

1207
01:26:13,950 --> 01:26:21,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: so that merong separate, basta depository bank ng gobyerno at accounts ng gobyerno,

1208
01:26:21,950 --> 01:26:24,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: eh dapat merong stricter scrutiny.

1209
01:26:24,950 --> 01:26:25,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Hindi kaya?

1210
01:26:25,950 --> 01:26:26,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Hindi ba dapat?

1211
01:26:26,950 --> 01:26:27,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And I think that is with the government.

1212
01:26:27,950 --> 01:26:32,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And I think that is within your mandate and your powers.

1213
01:26:32,950 --> 01:26:37,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And you have the authority to create such rules, di ba?

1214
01:26:37,950 --> 01:26:41,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: To make that happen.

1215
01:26:41,950 --> 01:26:48,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: In specific case ng land bank po, ang kinurit namin sila,

1216
01:26:48,950 --> 01:26:55,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: ang sabi po sa amin ni Lynette, pag galing sa gobyerno ng impera,

1217
01:26:55,950 --> 01:26:57,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: may presumption of regularity.

1218
01:26:57,950 --> 01:27:00,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So hindi nila, hindi nila pinipigil.

1219
01:27:00,950 --> 01:27:05,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So ngayon, alam na nila na hindi pala ganun.

1220
01:27:05,950 --> 01:27:08,950
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Si ano po, si...

1221
01:27:08,950 --> 01:27:13,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And if I may add, we were still doing the hearings,

1222
01:27:13,950 --> 01:27:16,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and they already declared everything was above board.

1223
01:27:16,950 --> 01:27:21,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Hindi pa tapos yung hearing namin sa Blue Ribbon, sinabi ng land bank,

1224
01:27:21,950 --> 01:27:23,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: everything was above board.

1225
01:27:23,950 --> 01:27:25,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So parang...

1226
01:27:25,950 --> 01:27:32,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So ibig sabihin, pwedeng mag-withdraw ng 520 million cash every two weeks,

1227
01:27:32,950 --> 01:27:35,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and it's still above board, di ba?

1228
01:27:35,950 --> 01:27:37,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At kontraktor yung, di ba, know your...

1229
01:27:37,950 --> 01:27:40,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Isn't that part of know your customer rule?

1230
01:27:40,950 --> 01:27:44,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kontraktor yan, cash ang nilalabas, di ba?

1231
01:27:44,950 --> 01:27:48,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sorry if I have to pursue that, but you know, we want to address that.

1232
01:27:48,950 --> 01:27:51,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And AMLA, tama po si Senate President Nguyen,

1233
01:27:51,950 --> 01:27:56,950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: is front and center in this effort.

1234
01:28:00,950 --> 01:28:02,950
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Our Senate President.

1235
01:28:02,950 --> 01:28:07,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Just a caveat, nabanggit niyo po kasi yung sa AMLA,

1236
01:28:07,950 --> 01:28:09,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: kano na kayo ang head eh.

1237
01:28:09,950 --> 01:28:14,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung CTRs, Covered Transaction Report, o kaya yung predicate crimes,

1238
01:28:14,950 --> 01:28:18,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: o red flag, yun yung kaya nakakakilos ang AMLA eh.

1239
01:28:18,950 --> 01:28:21,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Merong isa pa po eh, paalala ko lang.

1240
01:28:21,950 --> 01:28:24,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ombudsman, di ba?

1241
01:28:24,950 --> 01:28:30,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pwede kayong i-authorize ng ombudsman na buksan ang kahit sino sa amin.

1242
01:28:30,950 --> 01:28:33,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kaming lahat nakapirma na sa waiver.

