3451
02:46:46,540 --> 02:46:55,540
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: MOOE also contributed strongly to the government's spending performance, owing to the implementation of social protection programs, agricultural services, and the development of a new government.

3452
02:46:55,560 --> 02:46:58,720
