03:10:14,600 --> 03:10:15,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: According to arrival also?

3687
03:10:16,400 --> 03:10:24,690
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, we'll allow you.

3688
03:10:25,190 --> 03:10:26,550
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And then rounds.

3689
03:10:27,310 --> 03:10:28,910
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We'll do the same rounds.

3690
03:10:29,590 --> 03:10:34,990
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, so we'll take a quick lunch break and we'll resume at 1.35.

