03:52:14,480 --> 03:52:16,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We just finished our presentations.

3695
03:52:16,600 --> 03:52:24,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But before we continue, the chair would like to acknowledge the presence of Senator Joel Villanueva, who just joined us.

3696
03:52:24,340 --> 03:52:31,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So it's now the question portion of each senator, according to arrival.

