Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Senators, Chairman, you mentioned earlier, I had preliminary questions just like all the senators had earlier.

3700
03:52:48,440 --> 03:52:55,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Actually, it's because Governor Ramona wanted to be excused.

3701
03:52:55,580 --> 03:52:58,600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes, exactly. So for the same reason, I also want to ask questions.

3702
03:52:58,620 --> 03:53:02,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, yes. Of course, to the lady from Taguig.

3703
03:53:02,620 --> 03:53:04,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Cayetano is now recognized.

3704
03:53:06,340 --> 03:53:07,400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So who's here?

3705
