Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: General.

3706
03:53:10,240 --> 03:53:15,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Deputy Governor Abenoja, please answer the queries of our senator.

3707
03:53:15,980 --> 03:53:22,980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Since I have the benefit, good afternoon, everyone, of being the last to ask questions and listening intently.

3708
03:53:23,640 --> 03:53:24,600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I was listening online.

3709
03:53:25,560 --> 03:53:29,960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: A lot of these are like follow-up questions to the questions of our colleagues to BSP.

3710
03:53:30,760 --> 03:53:37,740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So very quickly, Governor Remolona mentioned the reason for the inflation is the exposure to external risk.

3711
03:53:37,880 --> 03:53:39,200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then he mentioned Ukraine, etc.

3712
03:53:40,240 --> 03:53:43,800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then the question, one colleague asked, two colleagues asked,

3713
03:53:44,200 --> 03:53:47,020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, how is your readiness to adapt to change?

3714
03:53:47,300 --> 03:53:48,120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That was the question.

3715
03:53:48,240 --> 03:53:50,500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then the answer was, we are adapting.

3716
03:53:50,940 --> 03:53:51,080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

3717
03:53:51,640 --> 03:53:52,440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So I noted that.

3718
03:53:52,440 --> 03:54:00,360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I want to point out that the Senate has a committee on sustainable development goals, innovation, and futures thinking.

3719
03:54:00,480 --> 03:54:02,240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Secretary Balisakan knows this.

3720
03:54:02,720 --> 03:54:03,620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So futures thinking.

3721
03:54:03,860 --> 03:54:08,440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So in our capacity, during the budget, we chaired the...

3722
03:54:09,200 --> 03:54:09,840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We are...

3723
03:54:09,840 --> 03:54:14,060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We have been vice chair for the Committee on Finance for many years.

3724
03:54:14,200 --> 03:54:21,780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We were able to make amendments to the budget of certain agencies, namely DOH, DepEd, and DOST.

3725
03:54:22,000 --> 03:54:24,580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And this is the creation of futures thinking offices for them.

3726
03:54:25,080 --> 03:54:30,780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So when I heard the discussion and the answer of BSP that we were making, we were adjusting,

3727
03:54:31,380 --> 03:54:34,460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'd like you to consider if you should have a futures thinking office.

3728
03:54:35,020 --> 03:54:38,600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I did not mention DepEd because it is already embedded in their law,

3729
03:54:39,020 --> 03:54:39,820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that they have a futures thinking office.

3730
03:54:39,840 --> 03:54:46,260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So if you are part of this very important economic team, you may want to seriously consider this.

3731
03:54:46,320 --> 03:54:50,380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because the job of a futures thinking office is to do nothing but think of the future.

3732
03:54:50,780 --> 03:54:55,700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Just like the departments within your office who will lobby for limited funds,

3733
03:54:55,800 --> 03:55:03,360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: they will lobby for a budget that provides security for the future, that future-proofs the Philippines.

3734
03:55:03,800 --> 03:55:07,780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So maybe you can just give me a nod if you will want to consider that.

3735
03:55:07,780 --> 03:55:08,780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because these key agencies...

3736
03:55:09,840 --> 03:55:14,540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: These key agencies that I handled, that's why they have a budget for the futures thinking office.

3737
03:55:15,560 --> 03:55:18,700
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: Mr. Chair, this is an important suggestion.

3738
03:55:18,960 --> 03:55:22,440
BSP Deputy Governor Zeno Ronald R. Abenoja: It's something that we will be considering seriously.

3739
03:55:23,140 --> 03:55:23,640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay. It's just a small thing.

3740
03:55:24,080 --> 03:55:27,480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because it just requires somebody trained in futures thinking

3741
03:55:27,480 --> 03:55:32,000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and who will be at a fairly high level so that they can participate in the discussions.

3742
03:55:32,480 --> 03:55:38,120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I want you to know in other countries, they have a system such that they are thinking of seven years hence.

3743
03:55:38,120 --> 03:55:39,720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sorry, seven generations.

3744
03:55:39,840 --> 03:55:43,440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's for the benefit of the entire economic team.

3745
03:55:43,860 --> 03:55:45,920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Secretary De Leon, this is also important to you.

3746
03:55:46,280 --> 03:55:47,860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Seven generations hence.

3747
03:55:48,260 --> 03:55:50,120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There are countries that think of that.

3748
03:55:50,400 --> 03:55:54,900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So it's not just for the next storm, it's not just for El Nino that will come in two months.

3749
03:55:55,080 --> 03:55:56,260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Seven generations.

3750
03:55:56,520 --> 03:55:57,440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's how we have to plan.

3751
03:55:57,780 --> 03:55:59,800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Which goes to my next similar point.

3752
03:55:59,800 --> 03:56:08,800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But another colleague of ours, Senator Robin, asked about the direction on the joint exploration.

3753
03:56:09,840 --> 03:56:13,700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The joint exploration of gas with oil or gas with China.

3754
