Senator Pia S. Cayetano: during the time of the former President Marcos, Sr.,

3758
03:56:36,060 --> 03:56:37,920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: did we have oil

3759
03:56:37,920 --> 03:56:38,500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: exploration

3760
03:56:38,500 --> 03:56:39,100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: at that

3761
03:56:39,100 --> 03:56:39,520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: level.

3762
03:56:39,520 --> 03:56:44,900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And so at that level, 150 exploratory explorations were happening.

3763
03:56:45,040 --> 03:56:46,960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Which led to the discovery of Malampaya.

3764
03:56:47,300 --> 03:56:48,020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And that didn't happen again.

3765
03:56:48,620 --> 03:56:49,500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That didn't happen again.

3766
03:56:49,920 --> 03:56:53,300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So if we look now and look at our problems, because what is our planning?

3767
03:56:54,060 --> 03:56:55,560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's the future's thinking.

3768
03:56:55,680 --> 03:56:56,260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's the planning.

3769
03:56:56,400 --> 03:56:58,060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So imagine, that was 1970.

3770
03:56:58,360 --> 03:56:59,740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: 50 years since.

3771
03:57:00,200 --> 03:57:00,900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Hopefully now.

3772
03:57:01,160 --> 03:57:04,660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So when the BSP governor says we don't have our own gas,

3773
