Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I think what he meant is we have, because we have Malampaya gas.

3774
03:57:07,660 --> 03:57:08,540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But it's negligible.

3775
03:57:08,700 --> 03:57:09,500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's why he said none.

3776
03:57:09,520 --> 03:57:13,140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Imagine if we had

