05:58:57,500 --> 05:59:09,060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, that's what we were talking about for the past year. So 5-6% ang sinasabi natin. Alam naman natin ang katotohanan, hindi naman nasa kalahati pa. Menos pa sa kalahati noon.

6206
05:59:09,060 --> 05:59:27,000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: E hindi ba dapat maging realidad ang ating pagpaplano? Why are we budgeting for the impossible? It's a declining economy and we are declaring an increase in collections of 9.2%. Are we completely mad or delusional?

6207
05:59:27,500 --> 05:59:39,180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Dahil hindi naman ito totoo eh. Paano ba ito? Anong mga specific sectors are we expected to drive the acceleration in growth for 2027?

6208
05:59:39,180 --> 05:59:53,620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nabanggit na po, paulit-ulit natin, inaasahan, public infrastructure. Okay, we understand that. We're trying to ratchet that up. Pero itong weak sentiment na tinutukoy, alam naman natin, isang taon na nakalipas eh, hindi pa nasusog.

6209
05:59:53,620 --> 05:59:59,920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ngayon, nagumpisa na naman ang ulan. Nasa isipan na naman ng madla itong flood control.

6210
06:00:00,000 --> 06:00:06,580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So ano ba talaga ang mga sektor na inaasahan natin to ratchet up this collection?

6211
06:00:06,820 --> 06:00:12,860
