6212
06:00:13,080 --> 06:00:18,420
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: Mr. Chair, Your Honor, I think the explanation lies in the definitions that you are using.

6213
06:00:19,440 --> 06:00:21,720
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: The macroeconomic assumption of GDP...

6214
06:00:21,720 --> 06:00:26,700
