6215
06:00:26,700 --> 06:00:29,620
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: Yes, Your Honor, I stand corrected.

6216
06:00:30,000 --> 06:00:35,120
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: The macroeconomic assumption of GDP growth of 5% to 6% is real GDP.

6217
06:00:35,800 --> 06:00:39,660
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: And it also has an inflation factor of 4% to 5%.

6218
06:00:39,660 --> 06:00:43,940
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: So when we do our tax collections, we use nominal numbers.

6219
06:00:44,340 --> 06:00:47,980
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: So we're using the nominal GDP growth and not the real GDP growth.

6220
06:00:48,480 --> 06:00:50,200
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: So if you add the real GDP...

6221
06:00:50,200 --> 06:00:56,860
