6222
06:00:57,040 --> 06:00:58,760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Which is the suspicion of many.

6223
06:00:58,760 --> 06:01:03,440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Not merely economists, econometricians, or even legislators.

6224
06:01:04,180 --> 06:01:05,380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Mas mababa pa eh.

6225
06:01:06,160 --> 06:01:13,420
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: Your Honor, that's why the DEPDev generates the macroeconomic assumptions that we use to estimate our collections.

6226
06:01:14,480 --> 06:01:23,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: So the macroeconomic assumptions that we were given is real GDP of 5% to 6% and inflation of 4% to 5%.

6227
06:01:23,080 --> 06:01:26,880
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: So the nominal GDP growth should be at least 9%.

6228
06:01:26,880 --> 06:01:28,440
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: Which is why our tax collection...

