7554
07:18:58,040 --> 07:19:02,780
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: you can generate one percentage point of GDP growth.

7555
07:19:03,560 --> 07:19:11,420
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: And then, that will hopefully redound also to improvement in sentiments in the private sector

7556
07:19:11,420 --> 07:19:19,920
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: because the private sector investment responds quite strongly as well to public sector investment.

7557
07:19:19,920 --> 07:19:20,920
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: That's why...

7558
07:19:21,360 --> 07:19:22,220
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: I think that can happen.

7559
07:19:22,220 --> 07:19:27,080
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: And then, hopefully, we will see continued deceleration of inflation.

7560
07:19:29,240 --> 07:19:31,880
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: 6.2% hopefully, I think, in August.

7561
07:19:33,880 --> 07:19:38,600
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: We hope to get that further decline.

7562
07:19:39,280 --> 07:19:40,800
