7761
07:34:30,380 --> 07:34:32,360
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: and now the war in Iran.

7762
07:34:33,140 --> 07:34:36,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: So I think the dilemma is

7763
07:34:36,080 --> 07:34:39,880
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: when the macroeconomic assumptions are made,

7764
07:34:40,100 --> 07:34:44,380
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: they're made without the ability

7765
07:34:44,380 --> 07:34:48,860
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: to predict such black swan events

7766
