DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: or such global external shocks

7767
07:34:53,880 --> 07:34:55,200
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: that are beyond our control.

7768
07:34:55,760 --> 07:34:57,740
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: So what happens is when you compare

7769
